{"docKey":"0084_largest_rectangle_in_histogram","code":"from typing import List\n\nclass Solution:\n    \"\"\"\n    柱状图中最大的矩形 - 单调栈\n\n    核心思想：\n    对于每个柱子 heights[i]，如果能快速知道左侧第一个比它矮的位置 left[i]\n    和右侧第一个比它矮的位置 right[i]，那么以 heights[i] 为高的最大矩形宽度\n    就是 right[i] - left[i] - 1。\n\n    单调栈的作用：\n    维护一个单调递增的栈，栈中存储柱子的索引。\n    当遇到比栈顶矮的柱子时，栈顶柱子的右边界就确定了。\n\n    哨兵技巧：\n    在数组首尾添加高度为0的哨兵，确保所有柱子都能被处理，且栈永不为空。\n\n    与接雨水的区别：\n    - 接雨水找两边第一个比它高的，用递减栈\n    - 最大矩形找两边第一个比它矮的，用递增栈\n\n    时间复杂度：O(n)\n    空间复杂度：O(n)\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def largestRectangleArea(self, heights: List[int]) -> int:\n        # 首尾加哨兵0，确保所有柱子都能被处理，且栈永不为空\n        heights = [0] + heights + [0]\n        stack = []\n        max_area = 0\n\n        for i in range(len(heights)):\n            # 当前柱子比栈顶矮，栈顶柱子的右边界确定\n            while stack and heights[stack[-1]] > heights[i]:\n                h = heights[stack.pop()]  # 栈顶柱子的高度\n                # 此时栈顶是左边第一个小于h的柱子索引\n                width = i - stack[-1] - 1\n                max_area = max(max_area, h * width)\n            stack.append(i)\n\n        return max_area","method":"largestRectangleArea","paramNames":["heights"],"args":["[2,1,5,6,2,3]"],"expected":"10","result":10,"events":[{"line":29,"locals":{"heights":[2,1,5,6,2,3]},"depth":1},{"line":30,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0]},"depth":1},{"line":31,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[]},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[],"max_area":0},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[],"max_area":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":40,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[],"max_area":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":0,"i":0},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":0,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":40,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":0,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,1],"max_area":0,"i":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,1],"max_area":0,"i":2},"depth":1},{"line":36,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,1],"max_area":0,"i":2},"depth":1},{"line":38,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":0,"i":2,"h":2},"depth":1},{"line":39,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":0,"i":2,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":2,"i":2,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":40,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0],"max_area":2,"i":2,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2],"max_area":2,"i":2,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2],"max_area":2,"i":3,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":40,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2],"max_area":2,"i":3,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":2,"i":3,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":2,"i":4,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":40,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":2,"i":4,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":33,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3,4],"max_area":2,"i":4,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3,4],"max_area":2,"i":5,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":36,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3,4],"max_area":2,"i":5,"h":2,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":38,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":2,"i":5,"h":6,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":39,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":2,"i":5,"h":6,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":35,"locals":{"heights":[0,2,1,5,6,2,3,0],"stack":[0,2,3],"max_area":6,"i":5,"h":6,"width":1},"depth":1},{"line":36,"l